    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d107">

                <pb facs="0511" n="391" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg391"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">550 E 1/111</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Italian Embassy to the Department of
                    State</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi></p>
                <p>Owing to the protracted crisis of the Italian Cabinet, the Royal Government has
                    found itself in the impossibility of maintaining unchanged the date of March 8th
                    chosen by the Supreme Council for the Genoa Conference.</p>
                <pb facs="0512" n="392" xml:id="pg392"/>
                <p>The Italian Government has therefore been compelled to postpone the convening of
                    the Conference and to communicate such a decision to every Government invited to
                    said Conference.</p>
                <p>The Italian Government will get in touch with every Allied Government in order to
                    choose of one accord a new date.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1922-02-26"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">February 26, 1922</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
